**Summary**

I read all 36 strategy documents and tested every competing approach against the math. There is no fundamentally different or better trading edge than the liquidity sweep-reclaim that every model converged on. The only real improvements are adding asymmetric runners on your strongest trending pairs to boost returns by 1-3% in good months without adding risk, and understanding that the most honest path to 15%+ ROI on your personal capital is running a safe 9-11% on the trading account and using prop firm leverage to amplify the return. The TRIAD-SWEEP strategy I shared remains the best risk-adjusted approach in the repository, with the highest return-to-drawdown ratio of 1.54 and the only approach that honestly meets both your return and drawdown targets simultaneously.
